{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes Untold is a cinematic puzzle-adventure set in a world fractured by time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lone traveler navigating strange environments, guided only by echoes of distant sounds\u2014 each with its own history, agenda, and truth. Harness a unique time-slowing ability to solve dynamic platforming puzzles, uncover hidden paths, and reveal the secrets of a world that remembers everything you've done \u2014 and everything you haven't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/2897ab62ff25a4b17fb5c7c7ecdc7fe0.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/2897ab62ff25a4b17fb5c7c7ecdc7fe0.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical puzzles shift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the double-jump unlocked,  \u2014 it\u2019s no longer about where you land, but when you commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.mp4?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal of traversals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-jump unlocked, verticality becomes a part of the overview.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.mp4?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ledge Catch After Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering ledge grabs turns a near-miss into a save.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.mp4?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Foes That Try to Slow you down</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are are a part of this world.<br>Ever present, waiting for you to make an appearance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.mp4?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Button Activation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One step changes everything.</strong><br>Shifting the terrain itself \u2014 opening new paths, revealing truths, or collapsing the familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.poster.avif?t=1765303114\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.webm?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.mp4?t=1765303114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story About Time, Perspective, and Identity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Echo is a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if your greatest strength was the ability to pause time \u2014 not to escape, but to listen?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d2726066ca6c011df361f92e490b5ca6.avif?t=1765303114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras_big/d2726066ca6c011df361f92e490b5ca6.webp?t=1765303